        "example": "Imagine an executive business assistant (JavaScript) who speaks multiple languages, coordinates executive calendars, answers phone calls, and negotiates contracts with remarkable versatility. However, when the company needs to perform advanced structural engineering stress calculations for a skyscraper, the assistant does not spend three weeks working through differential equations on paper. Instead, she hands the engineering blueprint directly to a licensed structural physicist equipped with a specialized supercomputing workstation (WebAssembly). The physicist calculates the stress tensors with blazing mathematical speed and hands the clean numbers back to the assistant.",
